  "body": "Prestigious Mon Desir apartment offering spacious open-plan living, 3 generous bedrooms, the master has a walk-in robe and ensuite, a family bathroom, separate laundry and toilet. Set amongst manicured gardens with a heated pool, gym, direct beach access, and, for peace of mind, an on-site manager. This desirable apartment has a covered balcony to enjoy the morning sun, two car parks, plus off-street parking for visitors and a spacious lock-up storage area. This is the ultimate chic lock-n-leave apartment set just one back from the beach in the centre of vibrant Takapuna with a myriad of eateries, shopping and entertainment on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nKey Features You’ll Love:\r\n• 3 Bedrooms\r\n• 2 Bathrooms including ensuite & walk-in robe\r\n• 2 car parks, plus multiple off-street visitor parking\r\n• Storage room: 2.2m wide, 1.5m deep, 2.5m high\r\n• Indoor/outdoor flow onto large balcony\r\n• Amenities: Swimming pool, gym, herb garden, landscaped grounds, direct beach access\r\n• School zoned: Westlake Girls, Takapuna Grammar School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate & Takapuna School\r\n• Close proximity to Shore City Shopping Centre, Takapuna Beach, Bruce Mason Theatre, motorways, public transport and amenities\r\n\r\n2C/171 Hurstmere Road, Takapuna: This is the lifestyle you've been searching for. Arrange your private viewing today.",
